<title>GREECE: COMMERCIAL BANK HOLDS EXPORT LOAN CONFERENCE.</title>
<headline>COMMERCIAL BANK HOLDS EXPORT LOAN CONFERENCE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Commercial Bank and the Panhellenic Exporters Association held a conference on export loans in foreign currency and Japan's export-import bank loans (JEXIM) last Thursday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Speakers included exporters association president Christina Sakellaridi and Commercial Bank general manager George Michelis.</p>
<p>Commercial Bank manages JEXIM's loan facility. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
